
Channel Flags:
==============

crwpi
|||||
||||+- If you are invited this flag is set.
|||+-- If the channel is private this is set.
||+--- If you can write to this channel, it is set.
|+---- If you can read from this channel, it is set.
+----- Always set for channels.


User Flags:
===========

urwta
|||||
||||+- If user is away, it is set.
|||+-- If user is typing, it is set.
||+--- If you can write to this user, it is set.
|+---- If user can write to you, it is set.
+----- Always set for normal users, else the 'u' becomes 'o', for
       channel operator.  If the user's current channel is not the
       same as the one you are listing the 'u' becomes 'U' and 'o'
       becomes 'O'.

